// WP23 (design plan §7, decision 0022): a spring wheat stand at 200 plants per m2, 5
// rows 20 cm apart with 2.5 cm between plants, in a 1 x 1 m loam bed. Sown 10 April at
// 45 N, watered to field capacity every morning, non-limiting nitrogen (300 ppm NO3,
// decision 0020). The stand's own shade stops tillering (red:far-red).
